+### Account Cancellation & Incineration
+
+Cancelling an account (`Account::Cancellable`) makes it inactive right away but keeps its data. The recurring `Account::IncinerateDueJob` then permanently destroys accounts cancelled longer ago than `Account::Incineratable::INCINERATION_GRACE_PERIOD` (30 days), along with everything associated with them. Reactivating within the grace period restores the account untouched.
+
